{"top_name":"uart_fifo","modules":[{"name":"sync_byte_fifo","behavior":"Depth-8 synchronous byte FIFO with first-word fall-through output. It accepts in_data at a rising edge when in_valid and in_ready are high and rst is low; in_ready is high exactly when fewer than 8 bytes are waiting. out_data presents the oldest waiting byte and out_valid is high exactly when the FIFO is nonempty. It removes that byte at a rising edge when out_valid and out_ready are high and rst is low. A simultaneous enqueue and dequeue preserves acceptance order and occupancy. Synchronous active-high reset discards all waiting bytes and accepts nothing; afterward the FIFO is empty and in_ready is high. Handshake behavior is defined cycle-exactly even though its ports use protocol none metadata.","ports":[{"name":"clk","direction":"input","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"rst","direction":"input","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"in_data","direction":"input","width":8,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"in_valid","direction":"input","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"in_ready","direction":"output","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"out_data","direction":"output","width":8,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"out_valid","direction":"output","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"out_ready","direction":"input","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"}],"latency":1,"compare_mode":"fixed_latency","reset":{"signal":"rst","kind":"sync","active_high":true,"duration_cycles":5},"clock_domains":["clk"],"parameters":{"DEPTH":8},"examples":[{"inputs":{"rst":0,"in_data":165,"in_valid":0,"out_ready":0},"expected":{"in_ready":1,"out_data":0,"out_valid":0},"after_cycles":1},{"inputs":{"rst":0,"in_data":90,"in_valid":1,"out_ready":0},"expected":{"in_ready":1,"out_data":90,"out_valid":1},"after_cycles":1}]},{"name":"uart_tx","behavior":"Parameterized 8N1 transmitter with P=CLKS_PER_BIT and frame length 10*P. For each accepted tx_data byte, tx goes low just after its accepting edge, emits the eight sampled data bits least-significant bit first for P cycles each, then emits a high stop bit for P cycles. tx_ready is high while idle and during the last cycle of the stop bit, allowing a new byte to be accepted at the edge immediately following that cycle for back-to-back frames. tx and tx_ready depend only on registered state. Synchronous active-high reset abandons any frame and sets tx and tx_ready high; no byte is accepted on a reset edge. Handshake behavior is defined cycle-exactly even though its ports use protocol none metadata.","ports":[{"name":"clk","direction":"input","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"rst","direction":"input","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"tx_data","direction":"input","width":8,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"tx_valid","direction":"input","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"tx_ready","direction":"output","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"tx","direction":"output","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"}],"latency":0,"compare_mode":"fixed_latency","reset":{"signal":"rst","kind":"sync","active_high":true,"duration_cycles":5},"clock_domains":["clk"],"parameters":{"CLKS_PER_BIT":16},"examples":[{"inputs":{"rst":0,"tx_data":0,"tx_valid":0},"expected":{"tx":1,"tx_ready":1},"after_cycles":1},{"inputs":{"rst":0,"tx_data":0,"tx_valid":1},"expected":{"tx":0,"tx_ready":0},"after_cycles":1}]}],"connections":[{"src_module":"sync_byte_fifo","src_port":"out_data","dst_module":"uart_tx","dst_port":"tx_data"},{"src_module":"sync_byte_fifo","src_port":"out_valid","dst_module":"uart_tx","dst_port":"tx_valid"},{"src_module":"uart_tx","src_port":"tx_ready","dst_module":"sync_byte_fifo","dst_port":"out_ready"}],"external_ports":[{"name":"clk","direction":"input","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"rst","direction":"input","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"in_data","direction":"input","width":8,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"in_valid","direction":"input","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"in_ready","direction":"output","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"},{"name":"tx","direction":"output","width":1,"signed":false,"packed_dimensions":null,"clock_domain":"clk","protocol":"none"}]}